{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/epTI90Lm8AHbd2QI2ie7Tg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:13.096861+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/epTI90Lm8AHbd2QI2ie7Tg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9F2ZvbOLkW0gOP0lCAVIfVicWvDIYLWWyQ8wUvN9lkoibiboNlSd3yAuUA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR93lsF7ZDqjFicZqn1ot6tL6f3JO9NepxbC3icrj0potcHK89qscY08cKw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9F2ZvbOLkW0gOP0lCAVIfVicWvDIYLWWyQ8wUvN9lkoibiboNlSd3yAuUA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9LL5zmSt3AWOPTq65ibtJXqbtMvmFT6dCLZfp30hqTm7AwrlqDF03rrw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为促进全国心理学以及相关学科优秀大学生间的沟通交流，增进全国优秀大学生对北京林业大学心理学专业的学科发展和学术研究近况，吸引优秀大学生加入北林心理系进行深造，北京林业大学心理学系拟于</span><strong><span>2025年7月6日</span></strong><span>举行</span><strong><span>2025年</span></strong><span>“心之森”优秀大学生夏令营暨线上宣讲会活动。欢迎有志于就读</span><strong><span>北林心理学学术硕士、全日制及非全日制应用心理专业硕士（MAP）</span></strong><span>的学生踊跃报名参加！</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、学校与学科简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9M2SCrEMFJbBLzXIHJ90GsO6VWVD2qHfg6F282fjy8yRDCvRiaNr14YQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>北京林业大学是教育部直属，教育部、国家林业和草原局、北京市人民政府共建的全国重点大学，是国家首批“211工程”重点建设高校和国家“优势学科创新平台”建设项目试点高校，是国家“双一流”建设高校，具有优秀的办学传统和深厚的文化底蕴。</span></p><p><span>北京林业大学心理学系，成立于2002年，是北京市一流本科专业建设点，于2010年建立心理学一级硕士点，2018年获批应用心理专业硕士点。北林心理学系以心理咨询、儿童发展和生态文化为特色，在表达性艺术治疗、绘画心理分析、儿童青少年心理咨询、心理健康教育、社会心理服务、生态与环境心理等领域均颇有建树。学术型硕士研究生培养方向为心理咨询与治疗、生态环境与文化心理以及发展与教育心理。应用心理专业硕士研究生培养方向为临床心理与治疗、儿童发展与心理健康和管理心理学。本学科点立足中国文化、面向国际前沿、关注社会需要、积极开拓创新，师资力量雄厚，队伍极富潜力，有着自己独特的研究领域方向和优势。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9X3PrRWTSHlLnhgUtscdRJZln375cViaicXYZhIcHuweiaaKNZOOJSrobQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>2</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>二、申请条件</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9M2SCrEMFJbBLzXIHJ90GsO6VWVD2qHfg6F282fjy8yRDCvRiaNr14YQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 全国高校心理学、社会学、计算机、统计学、医学、生物学、管理学、语言学及教育学等专业2026年优秀应届本科毕业生（包括本校优秀毕业生），本科前5学期的总评成绩排名在本专业或本班级的前20%。</span></p><p><span>2. 热爱心理学，有志于从事心理咨询与治疗、发展与教育心理学或生态与文化心理学等方向的学习和研究工作，有较好的专业素养和较强的研究潜力。</span></p><p><span>3. 符合国家免试攻读硕士研究生的基本条件，预计可获得所在学校的推荐免试资格。</span></p><p><span>4. 品德优良、身体健康、遵纪守法，具有创新意识和团队精神，具有良好的组织协调能力，在校期间未受到过任何法纪处分。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9X3PrRWTSHlLnhgUtscdRJZln375cViaicXYZhIcHuweiaaKNZOOJSrobQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>3</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>三、申请材料</span><span></span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9M2SCrEMFJbBLzXIHJ90GsO6VWVD2qHfg6F282fjy8yRDCvRiaNr14YQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、附件1《北京林业大学心理学系2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请表》；</span></p><p><span>2、填写在线《北京林业大学心理学系2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营汇总表》，可扫描下方二维码填写：</span></p><p><span>【腾讯文档】北京林业大学心理学系2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营汇总表</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR97iahEonvZTruP6L5MyJDRdmTCpeYt9JQ5Q4szY6PIOvFljdlL52OF2A/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>3、本人身份证和学生证原件扫描件；</span></p><p><span>4、本科成绩单1份（前5学期）和专业排名证明，加盖学校教务处或院系公章（如因特殊情况暂时无法盖章的，须手写说明并申请人签字）；</span></p><p><span>5、两封专业任课教师推荐信，需要副教授及以上职称专家推荐；</span></p><p><span><span>6</span></span><span>、</span><span>外语水平证明</span><span>：如</span><span><span>CET</span></span><span>英语四、六级考试成绩单、英语专业四级成绩单或</span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>GRE</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>IELTS</span></span><span>考试等测试成绩单；</span></p></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span>7、其他证明材料：科研经历的相关证明，如发表的论文、科研项目立项书、专利发明、各类获奖或资格证书等材料的复印件，如无，此项可不提交。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9X3PrRWTSHlLnhgUtscdRJZln375cViaicXYZhIcHuweiaaKNZOOJSrobQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>4</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>四、报名程序</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9M2SCrEMFJbBLzXIHJ90GsO6VWVD2qHfg6F282fjy8yRDCvRiaNr14YQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>1、提交材料</span></span></strong></p><p><span>以上申请材料均需扫描成pdf文件，文件名分别为“1.夏令营申请表”“3.身份证和学生证”“4.本科成绩单”“5.教师推荐信”“6.外语水平证明”和“7.其他证明材料”，并将7个pdf文件存放于一个文件夹，压缩后发送至邮箱bjfupsy2021@163.com，压缩包和邮件主题均命名为“姓名+学校+夏令营报名”，报名截止时间为2025年6月26日。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>2、资格审核及名单公布</span></span></strong></p><p><span>我系将根据申请者提交的报名材料，以申请者的教育背景、学术水平、科研能力、综合能力等为主要依据，择优选定夏令营营员。选拔结果预计于6月30日后以邮件或电话形式通知相关学生，未入选者不再通知。</span></p><p><strong><span>3、参营费用：</span></strong><strong><span><span>夏令营不收取任何费用。</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9X3PrRWTSHlLnhgUtscdRJZln375cViaicXYZhIcHuweiaaKNZOOJSrobQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>5</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>五、活动安排</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9M2SCrEMFJbBLzXIHJ90GsO6VWVD2qHfg6F282fjy8yRDCvRiaNr14YQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>本次夏令营暨宣讲会均采用线上形式。</span></p><p><span>线上营员限30人，线上的活动时长是一天。线上活动包括暑期线上宣讲会（将进行直播）和分组线上活动（不直播），欢迎有志于报考北林心理学学术硕士或应用心理专业硕士（MAP）的学生踊跃报名参加，也欢迎对北林心理学系感兴趣的同仁观看暑期线上宣讲会直播。</span></p><p><span>观看直播请关注预约：</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9HUIwNHWop23bpeopQAtEfswRTMcrEtdyf0kZ9iamP8vicVWfjBSrticHg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9X3PrRWTSHlLnhgUtscdRJZln375cViaicXYZhIcHuweiaaKNZOOJSrobQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>6</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>六、其他事项</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9M2SCrEMFJbBLzXIHJ90GsO6VWVD2qHfg6F282fjy8yRDCvRiaNr14YQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>夏令营期间所有营员必须遵守北京林业大学有关规章制度和夏令营的要求与纪律，遵守夏令营的安排，按时参加线上活动。</span></p><p><span>关于夏令营各项事宜，如有变化，将在“北京林业大学心理学系”公众号通知公告，请及时关注。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Iu3FvERsZCs4c7ljYwa50Ht8spXsXlR9X3PrRWTSHlLnhgUtscdRJZln375cViaicXYZhIcHuweiaaKNZOOJSrobQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/epTI90Lm8AHbd2QI2ie7Tg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2025北京林业大学心之森夏令营申请表.docx</a></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>B</span></span><span><span>J</span></span><span><span>F</span></span><span><span>U</span></span><span><span>P</span></span><span><span>S</span></span><span><span>Y</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>所</span></span><span><span>属</span></span><span><span>单</span></span><span><span>位</span></span><span><span>丨</span></span><span><span>北</span></span><span><span>京</span></span><span><span>林</span></span><span><span>业</span></span><span><span>大</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>人</span></span><span><span>文</span></span><span><span>社</span></span><span><span>会</span></span><span><span>科</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>稿件来源丨陈慧</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>编</span></span><span><span>辑</span></span><span><span>排</span></span><span><span>版</span></span><span><span>丨李文静</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>推</span></span><span><span>送</span></span><span><span>审</span></span><span><span>核</span></span><span><span>丨杨阳 </span></span><span></span><span><span>金</span></span><span><span>灿</span></span><span><span>灿 </span></span><span></span><span><span>杨</span></span><span><span>智</span></span><span><span>辉</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"ec3c7b0d29518b0c2deeb89782a153906309a0a1fe26d6b7d8bd64ef907bf46c","textLength":1863,"sourceSha256":"f626a22f5d4be0ddf841a808a42ec4b361760670f2f4dbae6300d76768616a6d","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a0973e2cbdc1de2ff876","title":"2025年北京林业大学心理学系2025年“心之森”夏令营","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:13.096861+00:00"}
